# GRADE
fit goes from 0 to 100 and says how fair a test of the chosen experiment this story is. Around 90 and above, the story is clearly the kind the question is about and strong enough that its result would be read as an answer. Around 70, it fits and is good enough, with some doubt on one of the two. Below 50, either it only loosely matches the question or it is too weak for its result to mean anything.

# OUTPUT FORMAT
Return only a JSON object:
```json
{
  "experiment": "<the id of the experiment, exactly as listed above, or null when none is served>",
  "fit": <0-100, 0 when experiment is null>,
  "reason": "<1-2 sentences in {{ target_language }} on why this story is or is not a fair test>"
}
```

